@TodoApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5098

### 1. Get all items
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/2
Accept: application/json

### 2. Create an item (POST)
POST {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "walk dog",
  "isComplete": false
}

### 3. Get one item by id
GET {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/1
Accept: application/json

### 4. Update the item (PUT)
PUT {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "walk dog",
  "isComplete": true
}

### 5. Delete the item
DELETE {{TodoApi_HostAddress}}/api/TodoItems/2